NAME
    spaces - list memory spaces exposed by the attached core

SYNOPSIS
    spaces

DESCRIPTION
    Lists every named memory space published by the attached core along
    with its byte size and access mode (R/W or R/O). These names are the
    <space> arguments accepted by mem(1), write(1), dump(1), load(1),
    search(1), memfind(1), snapshot(1), watch(1), and bp(1).

EXAMPLES
    spaces

EXIT STATUS
    0   Space list printed.
    1   No target attached or session service fault.

SEE ALSO
    mem(1), write(1), dump(1), load(1), search(1), memfind(1), watch(1)
